---
---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="glow-orb about-orb"></div>
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="about-grid">

      <!-- Left: Avatar + Quick info -->
      <div class="about-left reveal">
        <div class="avatar-container">
          <div class="avatar">
            <img src="/picture.png" alt="Ahmad Hassan" />
          </div>
          <div class="avatar-ring"></div>
          <div class="avatar-badge">
            <span>🧪→🤖</span>
            <span>PharmD → ML</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-info">
          <div class="info-item">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Pakistan</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
            </svg>
            <span>PharmD · QAU · 3.9/4.0 cGPA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.99 12 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.95 3.38 2 2 0 0 1 3.94 1h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 8.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Freelancer · Superprof</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/>
            </svg>
            <span>ahmad.hds393@gmail.com</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Story -->
      <div class="about-right">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="section-label">About Me</span>
          <h2 class="section-heading">
            From Drug Molecules<br />
            to <span class="gradient-text">Neural Networks</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-story reveal">
          <p>
            I started my journey in pharmacy at Quaid-i-Azam University, graduating with a
            <strong>3.9/4.0 cGPA</strong> in 2024. But halfway through my degree in 2020, I discovered
            data science — and it changed everything.
          </p>
          <p>
            What began as curiosity quickly became expertise. I self-taught ML, Deep Learning,
            Computer Vision, NLP, and Generative AI while completing my PharmD. The analytical
            rigor of pharmaceutical sciences turned out to be the perfect foundation for understanding
            complex models and interpreting data.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today I combine that dual background with <strong>5+ years of hands-on experience</strong>
            in building and deploying ML systems — and I've turned that knowledge into
            <strong>1500+ hours of teaching</strong> on Superprof, mentoring over 100 students from
            non-technical backgrounds into ML practitioners.
          </p>
          <p>
            In March 2026 I completed the <strong>AIOPS Eduqual Level 6 Diploma</strong> at
            ALNafi — covering Cyber Security, DevOps, Cloud Architecture, and AI Systems —
            giving me a rare end-to-end perspective from data pipeline to production infrastructure.
            Alongside this, I am actively involved in <strong>AI Engineering and intelligent
            automation</strong>, designing and deploying AI-driven workflows and agents that
            solve real operational problems.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Current focus tags -->
        <div class="focus-tags reveal">
          <span class="section-label" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Current Focus</span>
          <div class="tag-list">
            <span class="tag">MLOps / AIOps</span>
            <span class="tag tag-cyan">Kubernetes (CKA/CKAD)</span>
            <span class="tag tag-green">Generative AI</span>
            <span class="tag">Cloud Security</span>
            <span class="tag tag-warn">n8n Automation</span>
            <span class="tag tag-cyan">AWS / Azure</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 100px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-orb {
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06), transparent 70%);
    top: 50%;
    right: -200px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Left column */
  .about-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .avatar-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .avatar img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  .avatar-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #22d3ee, #34d399) border-box;
    -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) padding-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
    -webkit-mask-composite: destination-out;
    mask-composite: exclude;
    animation: spin-slow 8s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes spin-slow {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .avatar-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -56px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .quick-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .info-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .info-item svg {
    color: var(--primary-light);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Right column */
  .section-heading {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .about-story {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .about-story p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about-story strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .focus-tags {
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .tag-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .about-left {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .avatar-container {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
    }
    .avatar {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
